Title: Open URLs, files and drawers through OpenURL and Workbench on AROS
Repository: libresprite
Base: 89ea7597ed1d779e85c0019555f5b97c7eac22f0
Requires: preceding patches in series
Date: 2026-11-16
Author: aros-libresprite project
Problem: The launcher uses posix_spawn and xdg-open, which AROS does not have.
Change: URLs go to openurl.library (URL_OpenA), files and drawers to workbench.library OpenWorkbenchObjectA; child processes are reported as unsupported, as on Android and the web.
Scope: AROS
Upstream: candidate
Verification: Built for mainline AROS x86_64 (GCC 10.5, SDK nightly 20261110); LibreSprite starts on nightly 20261113 (pool v1-1, 2026-11-16)
Removal: None planned.
---
